The '''king of Qym''' is head of state of [[Qym]], who holds [[wikipedia:absolute monarchy|absolute power]]. He is the head of the Qymish royal family, the [[House of Zhifol]]. The king is the commander-in-chief of the [[Qymish Armed Forces]] and the head of the [[Orders, decorations, and medals of Qym|Qymish national honors system]]. 

